  "cost": 0,
  "interpretation": "<p><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><strong>Interpretation notes:</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Dopamine is a neurotransmitter mainly produce in the nervous system and adrenal medulla, It plays a role in many brain functions like behaviour and cognition. </span><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Plasma and for Urine dopamine test are indicated in following Condition:</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Pheochromocytoma</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Paraganglioma</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Neuroblastoma</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Monitoring of Adrenal incidentaloma, Neuroblastoma after therapy.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Dopamine may be elevated after a medication withdrawal (Example Clonidine ,Alcohol) , in acute illness, with medications such as Tricyclic antidepressants,Buspirone,Anti-Psychotis, Cocaine, Levodopa etc.</span></p>",
